              Join Cond: (b.document_id = a.document_id)  𝄀
              Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
              ->  Table Scan on vector_ivf_equi_join.documents  𝄀
                    Runtime Filter Probe: b.document_id  𝄀
              ->  Table Scan on vector_ivf_equi_join.nullable_chunks
